cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ViAdminShift, please cite it as below."
title: "ViAdminShift: A Vietnamese Benchmark for Event-Level Knowledge Updates Built from the 2025 Administrative Reform"
type: dataset
version: "1.0"
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/LLaammTTeerr/ViAdminShift"
abstract: >-
  ViAdminShift is a Vietnamese benchmark built from the administrative reform in force from 1 July 2025 (63 provinces
  merged into 34, districts abolished, 10,035 communes reorganized into 3,321). It contains the benchmark items
  (data version 2025-07-01), retrieval contexts, probing sets with the exact prompts, the model outputs behind every
  reported result, annotation sheets, scorers and analysis code. Data, outputs and annotations are CC BY-SA 4.0
  (tiny-aya-global outputs CC BY-NC-SA 4.0); code is MIT.
keywords:
  - Vietnamese
  - benchmark
  - knowledge updates
  - temporal knowledge
  - large language models
  - administrative units
authors:
  - family-names: Phan
    given-names: Binh Nguyen Lam
    affiliation: "Faculty of Information Technology, University of Science, Vietnam National University, Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam"
  - family-names: Nguyen
    given-names: Thai Anh
    affiliation: "Faculty of Information Technology, Van Lang School of Technology, Van Lang University, Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam"
